  "title": "Under Pressure: The Role of Mechanics in Battery Degradation",
  "summary": "Mechanics is a critical factor influences degradation mechanisms. Unlike SEI formation or lithium plating, mechanical effects do not directly degrade the battery. Instead, they create the conditions that accelerate other degradation pathways, making them a central aspect of battery modeling.",
